# Coaching AI tools (show / hide)

Single switch: `SHOW_COACHING_AI_TOOLS` in `src/lib/coaching-content.ts`.

- **`false` (current):** hide the Premium AI tools band on `/coaching`, the “1 year free subscription…” offering bullet, and the AI tools FAQ.
- **`true`:** restore all three. Copy, logos, and layout stay in `COACHING_AI_TOOLS*` / `CoachingAiToolsSection` — do not delete them.

When Tim says “bring back the AI tools”, set `SHOW_COACHING_AI_TOOLS` to `true` and verify `/coaching` shows the band, offering bullet (`#PremiumAItools`), and FAQ.
